{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/11236","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/11236/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/11236/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/11236/events","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/11236","id":3105860937,"node_id":"I_kwDOJYd5Dc65H61J","number":11236,"title":"Copilot agent mode keeps failing to create/edit files on the remote SSH host and creates/edits files on the local machine instead","user":{"login":"BarkingPuppy","id":34590056,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NTkwMDU2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/34590056?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BarkingPuppy","html_url":"https://github.com/BarkingPuppy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BarkingPuppy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BarkingPuppy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BarkingPuppy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BarkingPuppy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BarkingPuppy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BarkingPuppy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BarkingPuppy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BarkingPuppy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BarkingPuppy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":5542124161,"node_id":"LA_kwDOJYd5Dc8AAAABSlYagQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/labels/out-of-scope","name":"out-of-scope","color":"E2A1C2","default":false,"description":""}],"state":"closed","locked":true,"assignees":[{"login":"connor4312","id":2230985,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzA5ODU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2230985?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312","html_url":"https://github.com/connor4312","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true}],"milestone":null,"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-05-31T18:09:45Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T20:56:58Z","closed_at":"2025-12-12T20:56:36Z","assignee":{"login":"connor4312","id":2230985,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzA5ODU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2230985?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312","html_url":"https://github.com/connor4312","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"<!-- Please search existing issues to avoid creating duplicates -->\n<!-- Please attach logs to help us diagnose your issue -->\nI'm running vscode-insiders on a Win11 machine, and develop my project on a remote Ubuntu server through remote-ssh. When working on the workspace `/home/sean/pubmedoa`, I tried to prompt the agent to edit the code (for example, \"Rewrite the code in the file `hello.py`\"), but instead of editing the existing file, the agent would create a file with the exact same path **on my local PC** (in this case, it created a `hello.py` under the path `C:\\home\\sean\\pubmedoa\\` and saved the edited code there.)\nThis wasn't an issue when I was using other AI agent extension with vscode, such as Cline; and after reading the log, I noticed that no matter how models used slash or backslash in the path when calling the tools (e.g., `create_file`, `list_dir`, etc.), it would always get interpreted into the path with backslash, which ended up being operated on my PC instead of the remote server.\nThis issue has been around for quite a while; it sometimes disappears after the update and will appear again after another update, forcing me to resort to other AI coding tools whenever it happens. I really hope this could be fixed.\n\n- Copilot Chat Extension Version: 0.28.2025053002 (reverting to older versions doesn't help)\n- VS Code Version: 1.101.0-insider\n- OS Version: Windows 11 23H2\n- Feature (e.g. agent/edit/ask mode): agent mode\n- Selected model (e.g. GPT 4.1, Claude 3.7 Sonnet): Claude Sonnet 4 (the issue persists even if switching to other models)\n- Logs: [GitHub Copilot Chat.log](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20534993/GitHub.Copilot.Chat.log)\n\nSteps to Reproduce:\n1. Connect to a remote host through Remote-SSH\n2. Open a workspace on the remote host\n3. Open Copilot chat and switch to agent mode\n4. Ask the model to create or edit a file\n5. The model ends up creating a file on the local machine instead of the remote server, or it has to achieve the goal through absurd methods (e.g., `echo ... > hello.py`) instead of calling the tool\n","closed_by":{"login":"connor4312","id":2230985,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzA5ODU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2230985?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312","html_url":"https://github.com/connor4312","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/11236/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/11236/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"not_planned","pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3012832548","html_url":"http