"user":{"login":"ntwilson","id":15835006,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODM1MDA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15835006?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson","html_url":"https://github.com/ntwilson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-12T18:34:35Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T18:34:35Z","body":"Here's an example:\n\n[panel_editAgent_a8af229b.copilotmd](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/24133355/panel_editAgent_a8af229b.copilotmd)\n\nParticularly of interest at the bottom:\n```\n🛠️ tooluse_L7VU3BpsRJilcUDIwr92Bw\nERROR while calling tool: File \\workspaces\\SafetyFirst\\SafetyFirst.Specs\\FSeqSpec.fs is outside of the workspace, and not open in an editor, and can't be read\nPlease check your input and try again.\n```\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3647672225/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3647851045","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/11236#issuecomment-3647851045","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/11236","id":3647851045,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc7Zbcol","user":{"login":"connor4312","id":2230985,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzA5ODU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2230985?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312","html_url":"https://github.com/connor4312","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2025-12-12T19:26:34Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T19:26:49Z","body":"It seems like this would be because the copilot chat extension is running on your local machine (`ui`) rather than the remote `workspace` which introduces path differences.\n\nThis is not the default configuration for the extension. Have you configured any `remote.extensionKind` in your settings?","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3647851045/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3648072385","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/11236#issuecomment-3648072385","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/11236","id":3648072385,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc7ZcSrB","user":{"login":"ntwilson","id":15835006,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1ODM1MDA2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/15835006?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson","html_url":"https://github.com/ntwilson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ntwilson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-12-12T20:39:33Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T20:39:33Z","body":"You're right! I found this in my settings.json\n```\n    \"remote.extensionKind\": {\n        \"GitHub.copilot\": [\n            \"ui\"\n        ],\n        \"GitHub.copilot-chat\": [\n            \"ui\"\n        ],\n    },\n```\nI don't know exactly how it got there, as I have no memory of changing that setting. But once I deleted that from the settings, then it started working properly.  Thanks!","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3648072385/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3648118447","html_url":"https://github.com/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/11236#issuecomment-3648118447","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/11236","id":3648118447,"node_id":"IC_kwDOJYd5Dc7Zcd6v","user":{"login":"connor4312","id":2230985,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMzA5ODU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2230985?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312","html_url":"https://github.com/connor4312","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/connor4312/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":true},"created_at":"2025-12-12T20:56:36Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T20:56:36Z","body":"Yup, that would be issue. Will close this out unless I hear other reports where that's not the case. Thanks for the verification 👍 ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/microsoft/vscode-copilot-release/issues/comments/3648118447/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]}